        "cooked": "<p>If you see a thread that is created by a spam account, be forewarned that when I delete the account that created that thread, I'm going to choose the option to also delete the thread itself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SO, if you post in that thread, your post is going to be lost.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Matchstickman, you asked about whether or not there used to be or still is a 'Notify Admin' button. I don't remember. I agree such a think would be nice to have. I'll ping Joel about it.</p>",
